  "text": "### How to Escalate  \n1. **Document Issue:** Summary, timeline, financial impact, efforts so far\n2. **Contact Escalation Authority:** Email + phone call (don't wait)\n3. **Provide Context:** Background, options considered, recommendation\n4. **Wait for Response:** Authority may ask questions (respond promptly)\n5. **Implement Decision:** Once authority decides, execute immediately\n6. **Update Stakeholders:** Inform customer, team, manager",
